  refresh, the supervise hint, the broker's placed order, the DPRequestCancelled
  scan) test the stored request id with utils.has_standing_dp_request, None
  before a request is adopted, instead of its truth value: DP request 0, the
  first request on a storage, was skipped by all five, so that node judged no
  DO request, never refreshed its request and missed the validators' cancel
